/*  A rabbit's text is put into an outer series by setting an item, not by inserting.
    Obligation broken: O4's text half: a stored text has to be copied to where it is stored. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Define names as a series of text with ("outer").
Pull a rabbit.
    Item 1 of names becomes "in" joined to "ner".
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State names.
